    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Spoken and written",
     "texto": [
      "In informal answers a recoverable subject can be omitted: **Ved ikke, om han kommer.** = I don't know if he'll come. The full form **Jeg ved ikke, om han kommer** is also natural both in speech and in writing. The choice depends on context and register, not on a rule that reserves one form for writing."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Informal and neutral",
     "texto": [
      "**Kan vi ses i eftermiddag?** = Can we meet this afternoon? is an everyday, neutral question. **Vi bør mødes i eftermiddag.** = We should meet this afternoon expresses a recommendation, not just a different register. Choose the sentence according to intention and context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
